{"release":{"id":311539285,"tag":"v3.0.1","author":"StoneT2000","name":"v3.0.1","draft":false,"prerelease":false,"createdAt":"2026-04-21T05:50:17Z","publishedAt":"2026-04-21T05:51:06Z","markdown":"## What's Changed\r\n* [Feature] Gymnasium >=1.1 support by @StoneT2000 in https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1094\r\n* [BugFix] Fix shape issue with cached resets when using an existing dataset of states by @StoneT2000 in https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1355\r\n* [Bugfix] Correctly add MultiAgent sensor configs to env by @fheller1 in https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1357\r\n* [Docs] Update installation docs with uv and latest mac sapien version by @StoneT2000 in https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1370\r\n* update task dexterity/rotate_single_object_in_hand  by @Jianshu-Hu in https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1377\r\n* fixed typo by @jack-sherman01 in https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1389\r\n* [Docs] Fix PlugCharger-v1 dense reward label by @Lidang-Jiang in https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1402\r\n* [BugFix] Fix AttributeError with gymnasium >= 1.0 in replay_trajectory by @Lidang-Jiang in https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1403\r\n* Fix potential XXE and environment signature mismatch by @RinZ27 in https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1392\r\n* [Docs] Update replay_for_il_baselines.sh to optionally use MS_ASSET_DIR by @StoneT2000 in https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1409\r\n* [Docs] Remove mention of beta, prepare for 3.0.0 release by @StoneT2000 in https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1410\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @fheller1 made their first contribution in https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1357\r\n* @Jianshu-Hu made their first contribution in https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1377\r\n* @jack-sherman01 made their first contribution in https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1389\r\n* @Lidang-Jiang made their first contribution in https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1402\r\n* @RinZ27 made their first contribution in https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1392\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/compare/v3.0.0b22...v3.0.1","html":"<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\">What's Changed</h2><a id=\"user-content-whats-changed\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: What's Changed\" href=\"#whats-changed\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>[Feature] Gymnasium &gt;=1.1 support by @StoneT2000 in <a href=\"https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1094\">https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1094</a>\n</li>\n<li>[BugFix] Fix shape issue with cached resets when using an existing dataset of states by @StoneT2000 in <a href=\"https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1355\">https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1355</a>\n</li>\n<li>[Bugfix] Correctly add MultiAgent sensor configs to env by @fheller1 in <a href=\"https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1357\">https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1357</a>\n</li>\n<li>[Docs] Update installation docs with uv and latest mac sapien version by @StoneT2000 in <a href=\"https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1370\">https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1370</a>\n</li>\n<li>update task dexterity/rotate_single_object_in_hand  by @Jianshu-Hu in <a href=\"https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1377\">https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1377</a>\n</li>\n<li>fixed typo by @jack-sherman01 in <a href=\"https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1389\">https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1389</a>\n</li>\n<li>[Docs] Fix PlugCharger-v1 dense reward label by @Lidang-Jiang in <a href=\"https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1402\">https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1402</a>\n</li>\n<li>[BugFix] Fix AttributeError with gymnasium &gt;= 1.0 in replay_trajectory by @Lidang-Jiang in <a href=\"https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1403\">https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1403</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fix potential XXE and environment signature mismatch by @RinZ27 in <a href=\"https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1392\">https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1392</a>\n</li>\n<li>[Docs] Update replay_for_il_baselines.sh to optionally use MS_ASSET_DIR by @StoneT2000 in <a href=\"https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1409\">https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1409</a>\n</li>\n<li>[Docs] Remove mention of beta, prepare for 3.0.0 release by @StoneT2000 in <a href=\"https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1410\">https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1410</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\">New Contributors</h2><a id=\"user-content-new-contributors\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: New Contributors\" href=\"#new-contributors\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>@fheller1 made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1357\">https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1357</a>\n</li>\n<li>@Jianshu-Hu made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1377\">https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1377</a>\n</li>\n<li>@jack-sherman01 made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1389\">https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1389</a>\n</li>\n<li>@Lidang-Jiang made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1402\">https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1402</a>\n</li>\n<li>@RinZ27 made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1392\">https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/pull/1392</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/compare/v3.0.0b22...v3.0.1\">https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill/compare/v3.0.0b22...v3.0.1</a></p>\n","assets":[]}}